Changes made to Monoio and monoio-tls:
- Removed the epoll, kqueue, IOCP and poll-io drivers, the legacy driver, the
  tokio-compat layer and all non-Linux platform support; io_uring is the only driver.
- Removed the CI configuration, docs and contributing files.
- Added raw io_uring access (monoio::uring) and Runtime::driver().
- Ported monoio-rustls, monoio-native-tls and monoio-io-wrapper into monoio::tls, dropped
  their unsafe_io and qat options and the unified rustls TlsStream alias, and updated them
  to this crate's APIs.
- Removed unused code, bumped all dependencies and adapted to their new APIs.
- Renamed the packages to adaptif-gatotkaca-monoio and adaptif-gatotkaca-monoio-macros
  (the library name stays `monoio`).

Modifications are made by csatrio for Adaptif (https://www.adaptif.co.id) and are made
available under the same MIT or Apache-2.0 terms.
